        "id": 11964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-06T17:10:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Labels tell you where the target lives.\nFrom the bazel site: The name of a target is called its label. Every label uniquely identifies a target. It acts like a path.",
      "parentUuid": "2c7e47e9_c525acb6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
